/*
 * Dispatches composite expressions to the appropriate semantic-validation
 * module.
 *
 * Composite expressions(`ComposeExpr`) represent high-level syntactic
 * constructs that allocate, transform, or restructure values:
 *
 *   - lambda expressions,
 *   - list/array compositions,
 *   - slice allocations,
 *   - map compositions,
 *   - tuple compositions,
 *   - option(`try`) compositions,
 *   - `for`-based slice/map comprehensions.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
